---
import ContentLayout from '~/layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Drug Discovery & R&D"
  description="How workflow and agentic automation are applied at the first stage of the pharma value chain — from lab data pipelines to closed-loop AI scientists."
  eyebrow="01 — Drug Discovery & R&D"
  heading="The closed-loop <em>scientist.</em>"
  lede="The slowest, most failure-prone stage — historically a manual marathon of compiling data and screening thousands of molecules. This is where agentic systems are making their boldest claims."
>

  <section class="stage-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stage-grid">
        <article class="stage-block wf-block">
          <div class="block-head">
            <span class="chip wf-chip">Workflow</span>
            <span class="block-label">Structuring the lab</span>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Automated data pipelines and electronic lab notebooks replacing manual capture</li>
            <li>Harmonised data definitions across pre-clinical and clinical teams</li>
            <li>Lab-instrument integration and high-throughput screening orchestration</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="stage-block ag-block">
          <div class="block-head">
            <span class="chip ag-chip">Agentic</span>
            <span class="block-label">The closed-loop scientist</span>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Multi-agent systems run the Design–Make–Test–Analyze (DMTA) cycle autonomously</li>
            <li>Agents generate hypotheses, prioritise targets and design compounds in silico</li>
            <li>Predicting efficacy, ADMET and toxicity before a molecule is ever synthesised</li>
            <li>An "AI co-scientist" proposes and refines hypotheses with expert humans in the loop</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="stage-proof">
        <strong>In the wild:</strong> Insilico Medicine nominated a preclinical candidate after
        screening just 78 molecules; frameworks like CoScientist, ChemCrow and DrugAgent
        orchestrate cheminformatics and ML tasks end to end.
      </blockquote>

      <nav class="stage-nav">
        <a href="/value-chain" class="btn btn-ghost">← All stages</a>
        <a href="/value-chain/clinical-trials" class="btn btn-primary">02 Clinical Trials →</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>

<style>
  .stage-section { padding: 3rem 0 5rem; }
  .stage-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .stage-block {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem;
  }
  .block-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  .chip {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
  }
  .wf-chip { background-color: var(--color-accent); color: white; }
  .ag-chip { background-color: var(--color-signal); color: white; }
  .block-label { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.96rem; color: var(--color-text); }

  .stage-block ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .stage-block li {
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .stage-block li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55rem;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .wf-block li::before { background-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .ag-block li::before { background-color: var(--color-signal); }

  .stage-proof {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    font-style: italic;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-signal);
    padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .stage-proof strong { font-style: normal; color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 600; }

  .stage-nav { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .stage-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
